# Rendered by ../backend-entrypoint.sh at container start.
#
# Browser origins allowed to call the API. CorsValidationFilter rejects any Origin not
# listed here, and the dashboard's own XHRs carry one — so a missing origin does not read
# as a CORS problem to the operator. The SPA loads, the navigation works, the header says
# "awaiting-sso", and sign-in simply never completes.
#
# The entrypoint assembles the list, because envsubst cannot build one: the https:// origin
# users type (DOMAIN), the internal listener the dashboard is actually served on in the
# internal-dashboard modes (INTERNAL_PORT, reached as 127.0.0.1 or localhost — usually over
# an SSH tunnel), and anything else the operator names in DASHBOARD_ORIGINS.
allowed-origins:
${CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS_YAML}
